@ seconds left, header text -> header line and countdown drawn into PICT (one REPL)
\<< \-> left txt
  \<<
    PICT { #0d #0d }
    #131d #11d BLANK
    { #0d #0d } "TOTP" 2 \->GROB REPL
    left \->STR "s " + txt + 2 \->GROB DUP SIZE DROP #131d SWAP - #0d 2 \->LIST SWAP REPL
    IF left 0 > THEN { #0d #9d } left 131 * 30 / IP R\->B #2d BLANK NEG REPL END
    REPL
  \>>
\>>
